ming, providing excellent customer service with a smile. 😊\n\nWhat really stood out was the lovely ambiance — clean, cozy, and very relaxing. The environment added to the overall experience. 🪴🍽️\n\nOverall, Caprinos truly exceeded expectations. Highly recommended if you're a pizza lover or just in the mood for good food and a positive vibe! 🍕✨"",""text_translated"":"""",""published_at"":""2025-08-01T06:29:04.868567Z""},{""Name"":""Kaleem Rao"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmfBKjQQSWWMfvaBDF1-fs7_uNEonNcjZyqBKkhJVd_cRfMZ0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""I recently visited Caprinos Pizza Gulberg branch and I must say, it was an absolutely fantastic experience from start to finish. As someone who is always on the hunt for great pizza in Lahore, Caprinos genuinely exceeded my expectations.\n\nFirstly, the ambiance of the Gulberg branch is modern, cozy, and welcoming — perfect for a casual hangout with friends or even a family dinner. The staff was polite, well-trained, and extremely attentive throughout our visit. They made sure we were comfortable and helped us with great recommendations.\n\nComing to the food — phenomenal\n\nI also appreciate that they offer good portion sizes at reasonable prices, especially considering the quality and taste. The service was fast, and hygiene standards seemed excellent.\n\nOverall, Caprinos Gulberg has become one of my go-to pizza spots in Lahore. Highly recommended for all pizza lovers! Will definitely be visiting again soon."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmO4J-QVMhOaH4A7jZ1jLHYdS7xYYZC_X6krOzdUYSVPGw3AjMqP4ERqSKdxD8A-TCZkLXGhclOtC6v3ioIVQ4caQE9RfFfeSBNa6nexX5LAFoIXwhbVV1ZoZwn0S-WmSCSXJiZH=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNEUDM0_7RnpUFANV6ubcULXD8QLu96N1okFhWfUsa11wHGS1H861GivX4bW4ObLgzjU2W2tSANS0SPZE8DeMj8UHTj1HGIAZKZymWiL3tugQGkCS56_IMz3XJwX9YeTypj3ny0=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmN1I1K