cture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVa3g0YWhWLJDoKdfj3ChFi_cL2UbLF3G41yWt_1MN0x1vAdBmt=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""My self Shahraiz Talib\n*Broadway Pizza, Lahore – Review*\n\nI recently ordered the *Dancing Fajita* and *Phantom* pizzas in large thin crust from Broadway Pizza, DHA Phase 5, and was overall impressed with the quality and consistency.\n\n*Dancing Fajita – 4.5/5*\nThe Dancing Fajita offers a well-balanced flavor profile. The topping consists of seasoned chicken fajita strips, fresh capsicum, onions, and a generous layer of mozzarella-cheddar cheese. The sauce has a mild smoky undertone with moderate spice, making it suitable for a wide audience. The thin crust was baked to a crisp texture and maintained its structure during delivery. Portion size and topping distribution were excellent, with no shortage towards the edges. Delivery to Gulberg was completed within 30 minutes, and the food arrived hot and intact.\n\n*Phantom – 4/5*\nThe Phantom is targeted toward customers who prefer a higher spice level. It features spicy chicken, jalapeños, red chili, and Broadway’s signature phantom sauce. The heat builds gradually and is complemented by a subtle tangy-sweet base. Cheese quality and quantity were satisfactory, and the crust had a pleasant char. However, the additional sauce can make the center slightly oily if not consumed promptly. Recommended to be eaten fresh.\n\n*Service \u0026 Value*\nStaff handled the order professionally and confirmed spice preferences in advance. Pricing for a large pizza is approximately PKR 2,300, which is reasonable given the portion size and topping quality.\n\n*Conclusion*\nBroadway Pizza Lahore maintains strong consistency in taste and service. Dancing Fajita is recommended for balanced flavor, while Phantom is suitable for customers who enjoy spicy food. Both are good options for group orders."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMpXka-ULNNwfm_dxwwLT_vefUTFZbt3qhK-X2Zcjb1BnP_YLLOy3AUrAqQdgHRkde8Ghbtw_hDMfIGMHf8DM_KsCh6uAvFPs6pqEIGwAqdQFHu_AD6mUCt_zCtJ2WaZn6gv9GK68Bbtt8=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmO6QLoNudiUmmNRW5X087EF5XeSIkgh5R-SiQpNedsEpe-ppgu8ppIhiMdGzIyYdCUcH0pYbv25eV8xQtZZ7pk5gmkn-us4PJOMOV0laR4UXLJCursgBEk9K0lRE3ICCUTUCeoZ4pVb3mwC=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMzK6tPMGQ1GN1BbTHlC7fBGCbwVoWJsyIFIRjGJWyqCKrdoVfLVryGzPOlM7KYviQaplUPB4VjeCHUjabPAUx_Bnk1I_kU6IZh3V1VsgfK2xvhXexR8OCRF71V-vJjTVbt7-5NwMdIdif-=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPpkxAGOCL-g2BOpiDpqq8wLl06-eNIv7xkUuK2DljJyO-xX118A7NVehWBc6ye4DkAL3-10GaF_-cpqUpN6liCEYPWfvB7NIKat_4deLb2iGNOJScavjrASQhV9RI5Q0eh7V5odtv_gDJ_=k-no""],""When"":""4 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGJGZElURWRLT0dvdFdGSnpVbEJ2WjNGc2RVRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104527412100596587559/reviews?hl=en"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1777300910333025,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1777303554664703,""language"":""en"",""translated_lang"":"""",""text_original"":""My self Shahraiz Talib\n*Broadway Pizza, Lahore – Review*\n\nI recently ordered the *Dancing Fajita* and *Phantom* pizzas in large thin crust from Broadway Pizza, DHA Phase 5, and was overall impressed with the quality and consistency.\n\n*Dancing Fajita – 4.5/5*\nThe Dancing Fajita offers a well-balanced flavor profile. The topping consists of seasoned chicken fajita strips, fresh capsicum, onions, and a generous layer of mozzarella-cheddar cheese. The sauce has a mild smoky undertone with moderate spice, making it suitable for a wide audience. The thin crust was baked to a crisp texture and maintained its structure during delivery. Portion size and topping distribution were excellent, with no shortage towards the edges. Delivery to Gulberg was completed within 30 minutes, and the food arrived hot and intact.\n\n*Phantom – 4/5*\nThe Phantom is targeted toward customers who prefer a higher spice level. It features spicy chicken, jalapeños, red chili, and Broadway’s signature phantom sauce. The heat builds gradually and is complemented by a subtle tangy-sweet base. Cheese quality and quantity were satisfactory, and the crust had a pleasant char. However, the additional sauce can make the center slightly oily if not consumed promptly. Recommended to be eaten fresh.\n\n*Service \u0026 Value*\nStaff handled the order professionally and confirmed spice preferences in advance. Pricing for a large pizza is approximately PKR 2,300, which is reasonable given the portion size and topping quality.\n\n*Conclusion*\nBroadway Pizza Lahore maintains strong consistency in taste and service. Dancing Fajita is recommended for balanced flavor, while Phantom is suitable for customers who enjoy spicy food. Both are good options for group orders."",""text_translated"":"""",""published_at"":""2026-04-27T14:41:50.333025Z""},{""Name"":""Irfan Bashir"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVB3LREUZGeZr_ehn44btLwnO3_zUtu8-cFzzq3pF6nmRu0W0dkw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":2,""Description"":""Tried Broadway's new Kabab Pro Max Pizza. Unfortunately, the taste was quite average considering the high price. I expected better flavor and overall quality for the amount charged.\n\nThe service experience was also disappointing. The person at the counter was behaving unprofessionally with customers collecting Foodpanda orders, which created a negative impression. In addition, the order-taking process was very slow, resulting in a long waiting time.\n\nAnother inconvenience was that they were not accepting digital payment methods such as JazzCash and Easypaisa, which are commonly used by customers nowadays.\n\nOverall, the experience did not meet expectations. Improvements in food quality, customer service, and payment options would greatly enhance the customer experience."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.goo